  lines:
  - 'There are many jot notes scribbled around on a page:'
  - "\u201CIt didn\u2019t wake up until dusk when we angered it. It can\u2019t navigate
    in the daytime. Must be sensitive to light. Definitely more reactive to sound
    at night. Easier to hear in the dark? Light affects vision? Light level is directly
    connected to its senses.\u201D"
  - It reacts to sound huh? Maybe I can lure it away using Leblanc's walkie...
